WEBVTT

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.890
<b>Book 2: The Snow Continues to Fall</b>

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:36.990
<b>Episode 8: Confidential File 642, The Witching Hour</b>

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:03.220
You've lied plenty yourself, Tsuki!

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.180
More! Give me more!

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:14.610
You're the one who said the 
truth isn't what's important!

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:20.030
Even if it was a lie, 
I wanted to keep dreaming!

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:27.350
Dreaming, eh?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:33.460
I can understand the desire 
to lose yourself in a dream.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.590
Shut your mouth!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.970
Try a little harder, Yukimura.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:51.520
This is so much fun, Yukimura!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.150
Stop talking!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.740
What's so damn funny?!

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:19.180
Get off me!

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.140
You are enchanting.

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.840
So beautiful, Yukimura...

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.540
You've always been so 
strong and beautiful...

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.650
And now, you're going to...

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.900
It's over.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.570
What's so funny?!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.400
I'm just... glad...

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.410
What is so funny, Makoto Tsukishiro?!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:12.490
I thought that I didn't need the truth...

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.220
But you know...

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:19.880
The more you try to keep it hidden, 
the harder the truth tries to get out!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.790
I don't give a damn!

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.260
You murdered a helpless teacher!

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.470
You killed Asahi! And now you laugh about it?!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.220
Are you that glad to have ruined my life?!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:40.190
Of course I am... Because right now, 
I'm the center of your world...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.680
I don't have time for your madness!

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.200
Now, you die.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.960
That's the Yukimura I know...

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.710
I don't pity you.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:09.570
It'll be an honor to die by your sword.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.560
<i>Are you gonna kill?</i>

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:27.280
<i>You won't kill anyone else, 
and we can live together forever.</i>

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.400
Asa... hi...

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.740
You're thinking of someone 
else again, aren't you?

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:44.920
I suppose that was never 
going to be my role...

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.030
You are so beautiful.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:48.800
Stop!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:53.550
"I hold the world but as the world, Gratiano..."

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:52.300
No!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.740
"A stage where every man 
must play a part..."

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.060
Stop! Please stop talking!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.310
Come back, Yukimura.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.940
No!

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:31.420
Tsuki...

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.270
No...

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.770
Dead...

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:53.630
Everyone... Everyone keeps dying...

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.870
Take care of it.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:27.690
Right.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.130
You wanna tell me what's goin' on?!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.650
They were carryin' a body away!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.620
If you want to keep your 
brother alive, do as I say.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.200
Damn it all...

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.060
Hey!

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.230
Got another spot that needs cleaning up.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.310
Ow...

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.680
You keep drivin' like this, 
you're fixin' to kill her!

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.870
I won't let her die!

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:58.890
How do you feel?

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.910
You've been asleep for four days.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:07.760
I didn't think you'd be able to handle 
the trip to Tokyo, so I brought you here.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.810
It's an abandoned hut. No one will come by.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.850
You can rest easy.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:23.180
Some hot water. Once you drink it, 
I'll make something to eat.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.330
Asahi... Where's Asahi?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:34.380
The bodies were all put 
to rest respectfully.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:37.110
Put to rest...

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:41.620
Even with your enhanced healing, 
you probably still need more time.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.300
I'm going to get some food.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:48.620
I won't be gone long.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:17.530
Everyone... has died...

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:21.850
I'm the only one left alive... again.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.780
Because of this blood...

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:31.960
Everyone... the people who were 
so kind... who I cared about...

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:37.960
As long as even one of our 
clan survives... it won't end.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.100
You're right, Onii-chan.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.760
You were right all along.

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.760
Father... Mother...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.650
Onii-chan...

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.850
Asahi...

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.980
Everyone... I'm coming to see you...

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.130
Don't die!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.670
You aren't allowed to die!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:07.680
Please, I just want it to end...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.180
No! You have to live!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:13.180
Why?! Why won't you let me?!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.250
Why?!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.700
Please, let me die.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.920
It hurts... It's so painful...

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:31.060
And there's nothing I can do!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:36.660
Life is hard. And painful.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:41.040
Things are taken from you without cause, 
and you're constantly forced to submit.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:45.970
But that doesn't mean 
you're allowed to give up.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.470
Why? Why not?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.370
Why?! Why can't I?!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:54.140
I've had enough!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.560
It would be refuting everything 
you've been through!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:00.770
The mother who gave birth to you. 
The people who raised you.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:04.000
The ones you protected, 
the ones you ended, all of them!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.740
But... But I....

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.120
You can't erase what all of that meant!

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:13.160
Don't be ashamed of your 
blood! Don't curse it!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.520
Be proud.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:19.180
There is a point to it all. A reason 
why you were the one to survive.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:24.130
How... How could that possibly be?! Tell me!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.260
You spend your life searching for it!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.240
That's what you do! 
Without relying to others!

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.220
That's...

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:38.280
There's no way... I could
 ever understand that!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.160
Here. We don't need you getting sick.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.200
I know it must hurt...

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:16.470
losing everything while you alone 
manage to survive, somehow.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.200
You could never understand.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:23.590
You only saved me for 
the organization's sake.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:28.100
All I am to you... is a weapon 
that fights for the government...

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:31.500
for the Tokugawa.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.210
But Asahi wasn't like that.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.700
You're really cute when 
you smile, Onee-chan!

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:47.860
Asahi saw me as a person...

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:54.180
Even though... I killed her parents.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.250
I betrayed you.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:04.590
So that I could leave the 
organization... with Asahi.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.810
That doesn't matter now.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:17.980
Drink this.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.330
That's an order—

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.880
Kill me! Like you killed Hana!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.090
Stop that.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:36.910
No!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:40.870
Traitors have to die! 
That's how it works, isn't it?!

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.370
You showed no mercy to a pregnant woman!

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:46.150
You've killed so many already!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:50.110
If I keep living, I'll have to kill again...

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.520
I'll have to kill to survive!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.110
It should be easy for you!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.600
If you won't let me kill myself, then do it!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.450
Please...

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.680
Iori Makabe.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.010
That's my real name.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.400
My mother was alone when she 
gave birth to me and then died.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.110
I never knew what it was 
like to have family.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:35.600
I was worked to the bone and exploited, 
and I hated life for it...

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.310
And still, I chose to live.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:45.490
I killed a lot of people... 
so I could escape my own Hell.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.250
That said, even someone
 like me fell in love once.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:18:00.720
No one else had ever treated 
me like a person before.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.950
But she died.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.220
I can't understand what 
you're going through.

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:17.490
But... I do know the pain of 
losing someone you care about.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:21.400
No matter how badly you 
want it, they won't return.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.990
I wish I had never met her...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.520
It was fate.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.840
I should have never saved her...

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.290
You didn't have a choice.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.170
Why?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.210
It's not about logic. You did
 what your heart told you to do.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.470
But...

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.320
You couldn't have done anything else!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.280
You can relax. She's just asleep.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.030
Blood ties have a gravity 
of their own, it seems.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.430
I don't have long left.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:50.140
I can't move forward, and I can't turn back.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:57.920
You should stay by her side, 
no matter what else happens.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:02.100
I'm counting on you.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:15.040
Look at you. You have to be hungry.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.940
Come and have something to eat.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.340
Thanks for the invite to the party.

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:35.470
I promise you, it's a one-time deal.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.460
I guess I do owe you one...

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.890
It's been a while.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.470
One thing, though. Don't expect me 
to keep you company at night.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.930
Considering... y'know?

00:20:55.840 --> 00:21:00.440
Oh? You like them handsome too, huh?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:03.700
So, does she know about this?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.370
She lost her brother twice already.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.600
I don't want her going through 
anything like that again.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.710
I wonder...

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.770
One last job.
